Recruitzaa-FE v0.5.0. Full context: [CLAUDE.md](../../CLAUDE.md)

## Stack

React 18 | TypeScript | Redux Toolkit + RTK Query | Tailwind CSS
Auth: Firebase + custom role guard (candidate/employer/admin)
API: RTK Query (GET) + Axios (POST/PUT) + Zod validation
Forms: React Hook Form + Zod schemas
Testing: Vitest + React Testing Library
Build: Vite (port 5173)

## Commands

- `npm run dev` — start dev server (5173)
- `npm run verify` — lint + test + build (run before every commit)
- `npm run test` — vitest watch mode

## Key Files by Role

**Candidate:** routes `/candidate/jobs`, `/candidate/profile`, `/candidate/dashboard` — entry `src/pages/candidate/JobListingsPage.tsx` — state `jobs`, `profile`, `applications` slices — auth role `candidate` in `RoleGuard.tsx`

**Employer:** routes `/employer/dashboard`, `/employer/companies`, `/employer/profile` — entry `src/pages/employer/DashboardPage.tsx` — state `employer` slice — auth role `employer` (requires company verification)

**Admin:** routes `/admin/users`, `/admin/companies` — entry `src/pages/admin/UsersPage.tsx` — auth role `admin` only

## Critical Patterns

- Redux: use `useAppSelector(selectMyState)`, never direct store access
- API: validate every response with Zod at the boundary, never trust backend blindly
- Forms: React Hook Form + Zod, not raw uncontrolled inputs
- Dark mode: add `dark:` Tailwind prefix to every color/bg class
- Tests: cover auth and form flows, don't skip

## Common Tasks

- **Add job filter:** `src/features/jobs/jobsSlice.ts` (reducer) + `JobFilterPanel.tsx` (UI)
- **New auth role:** `auth.slice.ts` + `RoleGuard.tsx` + `routes.meta.ts`
- **Connect API endpoint:** `api.service.ts` + Zod schema in `lib/validation.ts` → Redux slice → component hook
- **Validate form input:** Zod schema in `lib/validation.ts` → form component → inline field errors

